WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.469
Once upon a time, there was a young boy.

2
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.505
He lived in a quiet village where many people owned sheep.

3
00:00:07.506 --> 00:00:11.958
The boy's job was to watch all the sheep.

4
00:00:11.959 --> 00:00:16.995
He had to protect them from hungry wolves.

5
00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:24.134
Looking after the sheep was easy, but it wasn't fun.

6
00:00:24.135 --> 00:00:27.691
"I'm so bored," he thought.

7
00:00:27.692 --> 00:00:36.102
"I wish something exciting would happen."

8
00:00:36.103 --> 00:00:40.705
One day the boy had an idea.

9
00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:43.257
He took a deep breath.

10
00:00:43.258 --> 00:00:46.975
"A wolf!" he shouted.

11
00:00:46.976 --> 00:00:52.146
"Help! There's a wolf!"

12
00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:57.876
The whole village heard the boy's cry.

13
00:00:57.877 --> 00:01:05.418
Everyone ran to the boy in fright.

14
00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:11.581
"Where is it? Where's the wolf?" an old man asked.

15
00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:15.158
The boy shrugged and tried to hide his grin.

16
00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:19.404
"Um . . . I guess it ran away."

17
00:01:19.405 --> 00:01:21.899
The villagers frowned.

18
00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.541
No one believed the boy.

19
00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:28.263
But what could they say?

20
00:01:28.264 --> 00:01:32.665
The next day the boy was watching the sheep again.

21
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:36.508
"Yesterday was fun," he thought.

22
00:01:36.509 --> 00:01:41.087
He giggled as he thought about how he had tricked the villagers.

23
00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:43.950
"I'll do it again!"

24
00:01:43.951 --> 00:01:46.872
The boy took a deep breath.

25
00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:56.388
"A wolf!" he shouted. "Help! There's a wolf!"

26
00:01:56.389 --> 00:02:00.566
The frightened villagers ran to the boy and looked around.

27
00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:04.284
"Where's the wolf?" a shopkeeper cried.

28
00:02:04.285 --> 00:02:09.677
"Yes, where is it?" the old man asked, frowning.

29
00:02:09.678 --> 00:02:16.818
The boy hid his grin. "It was just here, and then it ran off."

30
00:02:16.819 --> 00:02:19.908
The old man sighed.

31
00:02:19.909 --> 00:02:24.413
"Never cry 'Wolf!' when there is no wolf."

32
00:02:24.414 --> 00:02:31.142
The villagers nodded. "That's a bad idea, boy!"

33
00:02:31.143 --> 00:02:36.756
After everyone left, the boy burst out laughing.

34
00:02:36.757 --> 00:02:41.347
Baa! Baa! Suddenly he heard the sheep.

35
00:02:41.348 --> 00:02:43.681
The boy gulped.

36
00:02:43.682 --> 00:02:47.422
A big wolf was chasing the sheep!

37
00:02:47.423 --> 00:02:54.619
"A wolf!" the boy shouted. "Help! There's a wolf! Really!"

38
00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:59.483
All of the villagers heard the boy crying "Wolf!"

39
00:02:59.484 --> 00:03:03.132
But this time they were not going to fall for his trick.

40
00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:09.072
So everyone ignored his shouts.

41
00:03:09.073 --> 00:03:13.017
In the evening the villagers came to check on their sheep.

42
00:03:13.018 --> 00:03:15.979
But the sheep were gone.

43
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:22.874
The wolf had eaten them all up.

44
00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:28.657
The shopkeeper gasped. "Where are the sheep?"

45
00:03:28.658 --> 00:03:34.396
"I called 'Wolf!' but nobody came to help me," the boy said.

46
00:03:34.397 --> 00:03:40.168
"Of course nobody came to help you!" the old man snapped.

47
00:03:40.169 --> 00:03:47.109
The shopkeeper glared at the boy. "You tricked us twice!"

48
00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.647
The old man nodded.

49
00:03:49.648 --> 00:03:55.183
"You called 'Wolf!' when there was no wolf!"

50
00:03:55.184 --> 00:04:00.323
The boy hung his head. "Sorry."

51
00:04:00.324 --> 00:04:04.874
"You learned something today," the old man said.

52
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:14.360
"Nobody believes a liar, even when a liar tells the truth!"

